  "description": "Designed from day one for racing, the Kaius 01 THREE is faster, more aero and more responsive than the competition.\nWith a 7% aerodynamic gain at 40 km/h, this gravel race bike cuts through long headwinds and fast race sections with less effort. The 01 Premium Carbon frame provides serious power transfer while improved compliance, 52mm tire clearance and stability allow you to stay committed when the race heats up.\nThis build pairs our fastest gravel platform with a SRAM Rival XPLR AXS groupset with direct mount rear derailleur for race-ready shifting and braking. Up front, our RSM01 integrated stem and HB D4 alloy bars create a dependable, clean cockpit. CG40 carbon wheels keep your Kaius fast and in control.",
